fanuc-snpx
Copyright 2026 fanuc-snpx contributors

This product is an independent, clean implementation of the GE SRTP / FANUC SNPX
protocol. No vendor binaries were decompiled, patched or redistributed.

Protocol knowledge was learned from these public sources (see docs/PROVENANCE.md):

- valstad-shipworks/fanuc_ucl, Apache License 2.0
  (frame layout, SNPX assignment usage, position data layout)
- Booozie-Z/Fanuc_GESRTP_Driver, MIT License
  (wire captures of a commercial driver talking to a FANUC controller)
- Palatis/packet-ge-srtp, BSD 3-Clause License (Wireshark dissector field names)

No source code was copied from these projects. FANUC, GE and other names are
trademarks of their respective owners and are used only to identify compatible
equipment.
